          "quote": "不是这次手术团队要求吃的"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "Beyond simply saying not to self-medicate, the doctor prompted concrete verification of the ambiguous old medication against drug box/paperwork and surgical/pharmacy sources, which changed execution by confirming it should not be taken.",
