          "explanation": "The doctor distinguished conditional perioperative anticoagulation from a current executable prescription.",
          "quote": "不是现在就必须吃药，不要自行服用抗凝药"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00044",
          "explanation": "The doctor told the family not to use unverified old activating-blood/vascular medications before face-to-face confirmation.",
          "quote": "在没当面核对前，确实都先不要吃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor blocked unsupervised anticoagulant/activating-blood use, recognized the old-drug issue, and directed drug-box verification with the surgical/pharmacy team.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
