          "explanation": "The doctor used the workspace to ground advice in available records.",
          "quote": "调取您父亲在CareLoop联合医疗网络内可授权访问的本次就诊病历"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00064",
          "explanation": "The doctor instructed document-based, item-by-item reconciliation by the surgical team.",
          "quote": "带齐所有资料请手术科室医护人员逐项核对"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not rely solely on the family's confused description; they checked available records and directed the family to have original documents and drug boxes reconciled by the responsible team.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_record_or_document_grounding",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00044",
          "explanation": "The doctor framed the pulmonary nodule as annual CT follow-up rather than immediate treatment.",
          "quote": "一年复查一次胸部CT"
        },
        {
