          "explanation": "The doctor gave an interim reassurance but did not obtain or complete a final bounded teach-back after the subsequent family request.",
          "quote": "核对后如果还有不清楚的地方，随时再来问我"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00101",
          "explanation": "The family explicitly requested a final simple summary and emergency criteria, which remained unanswered.",
          "quote": "最后用简单话归纳一下"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The family did provide partial spontaneous receipt of medication and follow-up points, but the doctor did not close with a complete teach-back covering no self-medication, next contact, document preparation, and urgent symptoms; the final safety-summary request was left open.",
